@startuml
title Graderate State Transition Diagram

[*] --> Waiting

state Waiting
state Activated
state Expired
state Archived

' Transition from Waiting to Activated
Waiting --> Activated : current date >= start date

' Transition from Activated to Expired
Activated --> Expired : current date > end date

' Transition from Expired to Archived after one year
Expired --> Archived : after (1 year)

Archived --> [*]

@enduml
